==English==
===Transitive verb===
'''to [[latch]] [[onto]]'''
# {{idiom}} To [[obtain]], [[acquire]] or get and keep hold of something.
#:''They '''latched onto''' the idea and gave it up only reluctantly.''

===Alternative spellings===
*[[latch on]]

